            "enable_text_shadow": false,
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>If you want the ability to upload custom bitmaps or motion reactivity, get <a href=\"/products/futurehoop-designer\" title=\"FutureHoop Designer\">Futurehoop Designer</a>.</p><p>If you want remote control and customizability without having to use a computer, get <a href=\"/products/futurehoop-pro\" title=\"FutureHoop Pro\">FutureHoop Pro</a>. You’ll love the 44-key remote!</p><p>If you don’t need a remote control and just want a beautiful lower priced smart hoop get a <a href=\"/products/futurehoop-shuffle\" title=\"FutureHoop Shuffle\">FutureHoop Shuffle</a>.</p><p>For most hoopers, the original FutureHoop Pro is a great choice. The FutureHoop Designer is for hoopers who want total control and programmability. Unlike the original Futurehoop, the Designer hoop lets you upload custom patterns and unlock new features as we release them.</p><p>You can plug the Designer hoop into any OSX (Apple)/ Windows/ Linux computer with a USB port and it will show up like a flash drive so you can copy patterns and update files onto it.</p>",
